{"version": "v0.9", "updateDataModel": {"surfaceId": "intake", "value": {"understanding": "Here's what I found.  =PriceClient.get_price= in =checkout/pricing/client.py= calls pricing-svc once per cart line: about 14 calls per checkout at a p50 of 38 ms, so a third of checkout's latency.  Prices change a few times a day, and pricing-svc publishes =price.updated= on Kafka.\n\nI've filled in what I'd do.  Change anything, then press *Start*; I'll work from exactly this.  I left out the admin reprice path, which should always see fresh prices, and the reviewer, which I can't guess.", "files": ["checkout/pricing/cache.py (new)", "checkout/pricing/client.py", "checkout/common/caching.py", "checkout/app/deps.py"], "callsites": [{"site": "checkout/cart/totals.py:88", "fn": "line_total", "calls": "6", "note": ""}, {"site": "checkout/cart/promotions.py:142", "fn": "apply_bundle", "calls": "5", "note": ""}, {"site": "checkout/api/quote.py:57", "fn": "quote_handler", "calls": "3", "note": ""}, {"site": "checkout/admin/reprice.py:31", "fn": "reprice_order", "calls": "<1", "note": "needs fresh prices"}], "cache": {"strategy": ["inproc"], "module": "checkout/pricing/cache.py (new)", "budget": 64, "ttl": 300, "invalidation": ["ttl", "kafka"], "stale": false, "sites": ["checkout/cart/totals.py:88", "checkout/cart/promotions.py:142", "checkout/api/quote.py:57"], "flag": true, "metrics": true, "loadtest": true, "reviewer": "", "notes": ""}}}}
